OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Flocally thundery, showers continuing
OL,7,Fthis evening and overnight mixed with
OL,8,Fa few clear spells inbetween. Staying
OL,9,Fvery windy along the coasts and over
OL,10,Fthe hills. A milder night than
OL,11,Fprevious.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAnother mixed day with
OL,14,Foccasional sunny intervals and
OL,15,Fshowers. These heavy at times with the
OL,16,Frisk of thunder. Strong winds towards
OL,17,Fthe coast, easing slightly later.
OL,18,FTemperatures close to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
